    scenario: { en: "Your home fibre internet has dropped repeatedly for ten days despite two support tickets, disrupting live classes.", ar: "يتقطع إنترنت الألياف في منزلك منذ عشرة أيام رغم تذكرتي دعم مما عطّل دروسك المباشرة." },
    languageFocus: { en: "Diplomatic firmness ('Despite two previous tickets...', 'I must ask that...', 'Should this remain unresolved...').", ar: "الحزم الدبلوماسي وتوثيق أرقام التذاكر وتحديد مهلة واضحة." },
    teaching: [
      { en: "Effective escalation replaces anger with chronology: Ticket #1 → Ticket #2 → Measurable Disruption → Specific Remedy + Deadline.", ar: "التصعيد الفعّال يستبدل الغضب بالتسلسل الموثّق: التذكرة ١ ← التذكرة ٢ ← الأثر الفعلي ← الحل والمهلة." },
      { en: "Inverted conditionals ('Should this remain unresolved by Thursday...') sound poised and authoritative.", ar: "الشرطية الرسمية المقلوبة (Should this remain...) تمنح خطابك رصانة وهيبة." },
    ],
    example: "Dear Customer Relations Manager,\n\nI am writing regarding recurring fibre-internet outages on Account #90421 over the past ten days. Despite logging two support tickets (#4410 and #4589) and following every technician reset instruction, my connection still drops multiple times each evening, disrupting live online classes I teach.\n\nAs a long-standing customer who values reliable service, I kindly request two actions within forty-eight hours: first, dispatch a senior technician to inspect the external junction box; second, apply a pro-rata credit for the disrupted period. Should the fault remain unresolved by Thursday afternoon, I will regrettably need to transfer my subscription to another provider.\n\nYours faithfully,\nSami Al-Harbi",
